+SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY default is changed to 'same-origin'
+----------------------------------------------------------
+
+:setting:`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY` now defaults to ``'same-origin'``. With this
+enabled, :class:`~django.middleware.security.SecurityMiddleware` sets the
+:ref:`Referrer-Policy <referrer-policy>` header on responses.
+
+If your application requires sending referrer information to third-party sites
+when navigating cross-origin, you should explicitly set
+:setting:`SECURE_REFERRER_POLICY` to your desired policy (e.g.
+``'no-referrer-when-downgrade'`` or ``None`` to disable sending the header).
+
